- Effects: ring at (t.x, 0.1, 0.7) red, burst.
- If abs(player.x-t.x) <= t.radius: if shield>0 → blocked visual/floater, else damagePlayer(...). But damagePlayer sets ui.flash, setCount can call die. Good. Then `this.audio.bossSlam(); addShake(.55)`. If hit, maybe bigger shake.
- Else dodged: floater('DODGE', player.x, 3.2, 0.4, '#9ffbff',...), audio.slice? small; shock maybe.
- Set b.attackTimer = phase interval. `2.9 - (phase-1)*0.45 - Math.min(0.5, tier*0.05)` min 1.4.
- damage amount `Math.max(5, Math.round(run.count * (0.11 + tier*0.012)))`.

Important: `damagePlayer` has `this.hurtCooldown > 0` guard. If player was just hit by nothing, fine.

