`updateHUD` sector etc unaffected. Maybe hint during boss "DODGE THE SLAMS" — updateHUD continues and overwrites runHint every .08s. During boss we could set a boss-specific hint: in updateHUD set hint based on bossFight: `hint: run.bossFight ? 'BOSS FIGHT — DODGE THE SLAM RINGS' : ...`. Good. Add.

`offerPerk` condition add boss checks:
